WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Is there anyone in your ancestors who looked after things?

2
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:06,850
You should be talking about my father, right?

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,170
Didn’t my husband die of illness?

4
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:11,210
How can you still see things?

5
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,890
Mom lied to you

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:14,650
Your master didn’t die of illness

7
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,170
Was buried alive

8
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:18,210
Your husband got married when he was in his twenties

9
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,210
I was born a year later

10
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,810
He hid his ability to see things

11
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:25,670
So much so that a big disaster occurred

12
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:28,390
Cheng Zhong, my mother is hospitalized in the county town.

13
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:30,310
I'm going to take care of her for a week

14
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,430
Qiaoer can't live without me

15
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,020
I'll take her with me

16
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,230
Okay. Slow down on the road.

17
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:38,230
Qiaoer follows her mother well

18
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,150
When you come back, daddy will carve a puppy for you.

19
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:54,300
Well, I want Dabao

20
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,820
But in the process, Master

21
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,220
You are Master Qiu. You must help me.

22
00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,260
They said this about me

23
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,480
You have to be able to tune out of tune to do it.

24
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,630
I don't care anymore

25
00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:04,830
Please master

26
00:01:04,830 --> 00:01:07,100
Save my child

27
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,060
Okay, I will accept this.

28
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:10,340
You go back and wait for the letter

29
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,320
Mom, I want to take Dad

30
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,160
Carved bunny

31
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,200
Good boy, we've all come this far

32
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,400
How about we go home and play again?

33
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,360
No mom no mom

34
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,200
I want a bunny

35
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:24,510
Okay, mom will go back and get it for you.

36
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:26,270
Look at your daughter

37
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:27,670
I have to carve a little rabbit for you

38
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:31,950
Do you think you can escape or not?
